   "text": "Light gray text at 13 pixels on a white background is hard to read.\n\nBig, dark text on a plain background. Body text at 18 pixels or more, strong contrast, short paragraphs. Check it in sunlight.\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#smallbusinesswebsite #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
